[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_16]
Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_16_desc]
“God moves in mysterious ways.”\n§g“Derpy Hooves is not God!”§!\n“Will you tell her or shall I?”

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_16_TOOLTIP]
Derpy Hooves is thinking about independence or not, but what exactly she is thinking about, we will never know.

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_16]
马芬！

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_16_desc]
“神的行动总是诡异莫测。”\n§g“呆蹄才不是神！”§!\n“你去告诉她还是我去告诉她？”

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_16_TOOLTIP]
呆蹄在思考关于独立与否的问题，但是她究竟在想什么，我们永远不会知道。

